Global exception handlers

↓

Convert `ApplicationException` to HTTP responses.

Routers

↓

Do not handle application exceptions locally.

Use Cases

↓

Raise business exceptions.

Repositories

↓

Raise persistence exceptions.

Never reverse ownership.

